brides come and go. We had our own wedding plans completely fall apart 4 years ago and went to Jamaica just the two of us to get married.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It will only suck if you let it. Be as organized as you can. Use lists and spreadsheets if you&#039;re comfortable with them. Take breaks from the planning!! And the most important - do your best not to sweat the small stuff!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It all does come together and will be great!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903821,"PostDate":1441054125,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I've been on this site for a long time now and have seen a ton of brides come and go. We had our own wedding plans completely fall apart 4 years ago and went to Jamaica just the two of us to get married.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It will only suck if you let it. Be as organized as you can. Use lists and spreadsheets if you're comfortable with them. Take breaks from the planning!! And the most important - do your best not to sweat the small stuff!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It all does come together and will be great!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.228.47.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79540,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bfc1527e8f89e205d1a09eb351bc4611","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Aw man! Sorry you&#039;re overwhelmed. Maybe you can work backwards since you&#039;re stuck. Try to run through your mind how you see your wedding day...start to finish. Do you find yourself overlooking the beach, mountain, cliff? where is your reception? what&#039;s the decor like? what activities do you want to do with your group? Is a waterpark important for the kids? etc... Working backwards may give you an idea of what you want and then you can figure out the destination that would fit best. After that, ask around for a couple of referrals for a good TA who does groups, share your vision and voila! Resort selected! Hope this helps.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904080,"PostDate":1441232192,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Aw man! Sorry you're overwhelmed. Maybe you can work backwards since you're stuck. Try to run through your mind how you see your wedding day...start to finish. Do you find yourself overlooking the beach, mountain, cliff? where is your reception? what's the decor like? what activities do you want to do with your group? Is a waterpark important for the kids? etc... Working backwards may give you an idea of what you want and then you can figure out the destination that would fit best. After that, ask around for a couple of referrals for a good TA who does groups, share your vision and voila! Resort selected! Hope this helps.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"theniylife@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.228.60.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430516280,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"1weddingirl","Id":282948,"Name":"1weddingirl","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79540","Title":"Tell Me Wedding Planning Doesn't Suck....","LastPostDate":1441232192},"Pages":{"TotalItems":12,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
