{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":15,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1400,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1859030,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":275203,"Name":"trbutler","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275203.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1405030156,"LastPoster":{"Id":284300,"Name":"rahulthakur01","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":43,"Preview":{"Id":1859030,"PostDate":1405030156,"PostContent":"We are trying to make our wedding as fun as possible for our guests. \u00a0I have a couple of ideas fo...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"trbutleress@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.152.210.240","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1384958390,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275203.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"trbutler","Id":275203,"Name":"trbutler","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.152.210.240","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77503,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a6726bf6582a6075bf0db39b92d42180","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We are trying to make our wedding as fun as possible for our guests. &amp;nbsp;I have a couple of ideas for the wedding:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1 - Giving guests beach balls to throw during the recessional, we are also planning on playing Georgia Satellites - Keep your Hands to yourself :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2 - Having glow bracelets for the guests for during the dinner and rest of the evening&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3 - Doing a photo booth guest book with props and a chalk board to give us their wedding advice&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We aren&#039;t having a DJ, my FI parents are pretty reserved so we are just having a dinner and then the \"younger\" people are going to party the rest of the night away with some bar hopping.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Does anyone have any other FUN ideas!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1859030,"PostDate":1405030156,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are trying to make our wedding as fun as possible for our guests. \u00a0I have a couple of ideas for the wedding:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1 - Giving guests beach balls to throw during the recessional, we are also planning on playing Georgia Satellites - Keep your Hands to yourself <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>2 - Having glow bracelets for the guests for during the dinner and rest of the evening<\/p>\n<p>3 - Doing a photo booth guest book with props and a chalk board to give us their wedding advice<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We aren't having a DJ, my FI parents are pretty reserved so we are just having a dinner and then the \"younger\" people are going to party the rest of the night away with some bar hopping.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Does anyone have any other FUN ideas!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"trbutleress@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.152.210.240","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1384958390,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275203.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"trbutler","Id":275203,"Name":"trbutler","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.217.160.218","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77503,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0b87d4a61624e05c3fbf46be142cb660","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#0000ff;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;I just had a conversation with my bridesmaids about it too!!!!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#0000ff;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;how about these. I am thinking about the second with some Q&amp;amp;A:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Beanbag. Yes, it is not sandbag. This classic beanbag game can easily be DIYed for your wedding; add your&amp;nbsp;silhouettes&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;monograms, or get a set in your wedding colors. &lt;em&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.fotavo.com\/photos\/photo3XK5yw4la8912mpTcSMgoNvWU6hID70CuVLizdRA&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.fotavo.com\/photos\/photo3XK5yw4la8912mpTcSMgoNvWU6hID70CuVLizdRA&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n\t&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#0000ff;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Flip cup ~Start off this drinking game with a round of boys vs. girls: the groom and the groomsmen against the bride and bridesmaids! Then, open it up to the rest of the guests. &lt;em&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.fotavo.com\/photos\/photodo9lZ0ED8LUk5Gn1m23NYuxieMsXQCvjcBJtFhTp&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.fotavo.com\/photos\/photodo9lZ0ED8LUk5Gn1m23NYuxieMsXQCvjcBJtFhTp&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/em&gt; I like the game because it is much like a group game that can cheer up the whole guests.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ol&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1859199,"PostDate":1405182458,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">I just had a conversation with my bridesmaids about it too!!!!!<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">how about these. I am thinking about the second with some Q&A:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<ol><li>Beanbag. Yes, it is not sandbag. This classic beanbag game can easily be DIYed for your wedding; add your\u00a0silhouettes\u00a0or\u00a0monograms, or get a set in your wedding colors. <em><a href='http:\/\/www.fotavo.com\/photos\/photo3XK5yw4la8912mpTcSMgoNvWU6hID70CuVLizdRA' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.fotavo.co...6hID70CuVLizdRA<\/a><\/em><\/li>\n\t<li><span  style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Flip cup ~Start off this drinking game with a round of boys vs. girls: the groom and the groomsmen against the bride and bridesmaids! Then, open it up to the rest of the guests. <em><a href='http:\/\/www.fotavo.com\/photos\/photodo9lZ0ED8LUk5Gn1m23NYuxieMsXQCvjcBJtFhTp' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.fotavo.co...MsXQCvjcBJtFhTp<\/a><\/em> I like the game because it is much like a group game that can cheer up the whole guests.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ol>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.rr.jiang@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.108.142.231","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404561166,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"DeborahWed","Id":278839,"Name":"DeborahWed","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.108.237.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77503,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2f17fd5233582cf8ace60cce488fe3de","RawContent":"#1 and # 2 were on my list , it&#039;s great to see someone else with the same ideas.","Attachments":[],"Id":1861666,"PostDate":1406065984,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                #1 and # 2 were on my list , it's great to see someone else with the same ideas. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 AnnaTennille & Eric<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 May 16, 2015<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Montego Bay, Jamaica<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 <img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;484\/st\/20150516\/e\/The+Day+We+Say+I+Do%21\/k\/b124\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"a.johnson1013@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.108.237.58","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403180680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278601.jpg?_r=1403203318","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"atennille","Id":278601,"Name":"atennille","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.25.122","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77503,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a4705d93e56aa7a7e3ae122e23556197","RawContent":"Yup #1 and #2 are on my list too! And our photographer added in a photobooth with props to our package so we will have this at the reception. \n\n\nAlso planning on adding a go-pro camera to a bottle of tequila during the dance (saw this on a brides video and it was amazing and hilariously fun!) \n\n\nWe are having a DJ so hoping the party goes til 11pm outdoors and then moves to the disco after. Funny- we are considered old by many but still want to have a great FUN wedding. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1861670,"PostDate":1406068438,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yup #1 and #2 are on my list too! And our photographer added in a photobooth with props to our package so we will have this at the reception. <br><br>\nAlso planning on adding a go-pro camera to a bottle of tequila during the dance (saw this on a brides video and it was amazing and hilariously fun!) <br><br>\nWe are having a DJ so hoping the party goes til 11pm outdoors and then moves to the disco after. Funny- we are considered old by many but still want to have a great FUN wedding. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390238608,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77503,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"efca0ee81a4eb2a59ca1f969a271cedb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;One idea I have is chinese wish lanterns. It can be really pretty as well as thoughtful for the guests&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.wishlantern.com\/wedding-wish-lantern-packages&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.wishlantern.com\/wedding-wish-lantern-packages&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1862522,"PostDate":1406421625,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>One idea I have is chinese wish lanterns. It can be really pretty as well as thoughtful for the guests<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.wishlantern.com\/wedding-wish-lantern-packages' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.wishlante...antern-packages<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">I'm lucky I'm in love with my best friend<\/span><\/em>","Email":"lily_1202@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406372649,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279175.jpg?_r=1406605860","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lilian84","Id":279175,"Name":"Lilian84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.37.138","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77503,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"26bab2b79d2aaa10824ae11faaa1e1a7","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Lilian84\" post=\"1862522\" timestamp=\"1406439625\"]\nOne idea I have is chinese wish lanterns. It can be really pretty as well as thoughtful for the guests\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.wishlantern.com\/wedding-wish-lantern-packages\"]http:\/\/www.wishlantern.com\/wedding-wish-lantern-packages[\/url][\/quote]Ale sure you talk to your resorts. Many resorts are now banning these due to fire hazard- which I was bummed about since they are gorgeous... But alas they are not allowed at my resort! \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1862524,"PostDate":1406422816,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Lilian84, on 27 July 2014 - 12:40 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>One idea I have is chinese wish lanterns. It can be really pretty as well as thoughtful for the guests<br><a href='http:\/\/www.wishlantern.com\/wedding-wish-lantern-packages' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.wishlante...antern-packages<\/a><\/p><\/div><\/div>\nAle sure you talk to your resorts. Many resorts are now banning these due to fire hazard- which I was bummed about since they are gorgeous... But alas they are not allowed at my resort! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390238608,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77503,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e99812c100529547adf10340f4060984","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kmk2016\" post=\"1862524\" timestamp=\"1406440816\"]\nAle sure you talk to your resorts. Many resorts are now banning these due to fire hazard- which I was bummed about since they are gorgeous... But alas they are not allowed at my resort!\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]\nOh thank you for the tip... I didn&#039;t think of that, when the time comes I will be sure to check that out!","Attachments":[],"Id":1862525,"PostDate":1406423116,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kmk2016, on 27 July 2014 - 01:00 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Ale sure you talk to your resorts. Many resorts are now banning these due to fire hazard- which I was bummed about since they are gorgeous... But alas they are not allowed at my resort!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Oh thank you for the tip... I didn't think of that, when the time comes I will be sure to check that out!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">I'm lucky I'm in love with my best friend<\/span><\/em>","Email":"lily_1202@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406372649,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279175.jpg?_r=1406605860","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lilian84","Id":279175,"Name":"Lilian84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"167.246.60.1","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77503,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4e070e639b118086231db12adb923823","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;i love the go pro on the bottle of tequila!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are thinking of doing some sort of eye spy game during the reception.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1862994,"PostDate":1406626032,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>i love the go pro on the bottle of tequila!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are thinking of doing some sort of eye spy game during the reception.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nina1116@gmail.com","IpAddress":"167.246.60.1","GroupId":39,"G