  'messageContent' => 'Hi Lise,

I just wondered if you still want to sell your dress? I\'m getting close to getting ready for Mexico (6 weeks to go!!) and it will get to a point that the dress won\'t arrive before we leave. I\'m trying to get all of the wardrobe done in advance if I can.

Please let me know. If you aren\'t able to sell it that\'s perfectly OK. 

Hope married life is wonderful!!

Cheers!
Ann
