{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":19184,"Author":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1436885800,"Content":"<p>Hi! I might be interested in the dress. Do you find that the 14 is true to size, or bigger or smaller? Do you know the shipping costs to 15851? Candlelight - is it sort of a cream colour, or ivory?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks for any info!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n","PostKey":"5cfc0f69215e6238454974e37ae1844b","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19185,"Author":{"Id":282134,"Name":"Mrsntobe","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282134.jpg?_r=1441149164","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1436886804,"Content":"<p>Hey there,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The dress is interesting, as I'm small chested it is a bit roomy on the upper half, but I have hips (typically a 14 jean\/pants size) so it fits perfectly on the bottom. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We bought all my bridesmaids dresses through Donna Morgan and everyone found them true to size (nothing like our wonderful bridal wear!) <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It is definitely more of a cream colour with undertones of yellow in it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>USPS says I can do 3-day shipping with a tracking number for $6US. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let me know what you think!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Lise<\/p>\n","PostKey":"b8c2200b8b214739e91614e81de84024","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19195,"Author":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1436911457,"Content":"<p>Hi Lise! My name is Ann by the way lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm interested in the dress definitely. I think it will fit judging by your description. Do you use paypal? We're leaving for South Carolina on Friday afternoon but stopping at my son's in PA on the way home so thinking it's easiest to have it sent there. I'm in Canada but it makes it easy to have things sent in the US and just pick them up when we go down to visit.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let me know what works for you.<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n","PostKey":"f4f6d50a586c5e2c5ac17d1565ec1340","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19206,"Author":{"Id":282134,"Name":"Mrsntobe","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282134.jpg?_r=1441149164","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1436949944,"Content":"<p>HI Ann,<\/p>\n<p>\nSo great to \"e-meet\" you! \u00a0I'm actually from Ottawa, but have lived in Connecticut for the past 2 years with my fiancee. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I quickly looked at your story - is everything still on track for October for you? \u00a0We're heading to Playa Del Carmen in about 2.5 weeks for our wedding and party! \u00a0Looking forward to it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I can send it to PA or if you'd like I can just mail it to Canada for the same price. \u00a0I recently mailed two of my bridesmaids dresses to Ottawa from here - it took about 2 weeks but it was only about $11 for the shipping (and I'm fine with absorbing the difference in shipping - I'm not looking to make money off people, just trying to find a good home for the dress!) <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let me know what works best for you and I'm happy to do either. \u00a0I do have paypal as well so that works great - let me know and I can send you my email address for paypal.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Lise<\/p>\n","PostKey":"1262e1efb3511aa0e56836c8a4c108c0","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19209,"Author":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1436953305,"Content":"<p>Hi Lise! It's nice to \"e-meet\" you too! lol That is just too freaky.... I was born in Toronto but lived a large part of my life in Ottawa. I worked 15 years for the federal government and 6 years with Canada Post head office on\u00a0Heron Road. My ex and I split in 1999 and I left Ottawa for Toronto to get a fresh start (I had friends here). I've never looked back. My ex and I actually got back together for a short bit but it didn't work.\u00a0We have one of our kids that is in Ottawa and has 2 girls so we try to get there when we\u00a0can. I still have friends there but I hate the city with a passion! lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That's so exciting for you!! Have you done a planning thread yet?\u00a0Sorry -\u00a0being an administrator on the site I get involved with other things and\u00a0it's sometimes hard to keep track of when each bride is leaving. I try to keep up\u00a0but with the hours I work it's tough! lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Yes -\u00a0we fly on October 18th and our renewal is on our anniversary Oct 20th. We've decided on Valentin Imperial Maya now and just waiting for the TA's advice when to book and it may be this week. We're off to South Carolina on Friday so the TA has said he'll let me know tomorrow what we should do. Being in the US it won't be as easy to just pick up the phone since it costs so much. We keep phones on all the time since we both have very elderly parents but the kids know to only call if it's an emergency.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>One question - how do you get around the customs sending to Canada? I would be fine\u00a0with that only because it's\u00a0one less thing to have to worry about bringing back on our cross border allowance so if it's doable, absolutely\u00a0that would work but only\u00a0if they aren't going to hit\u00a0me for customs duty. I'm not worried about the cost.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let\u00a0me know how you sent the other dresses. Timing isn't critical since we don't leave until October so the 2 weeks is ok.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks a ton!!<\/p>\n<p>Ann<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n","PostKey":"04e1164329a2c10ec3be21f6898e6ae4","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19330,"Author":{"Id":282134,"Name":"Mrsntobe","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282134.jpg?_r=1441149164","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1437484525,"Content":"<p>HI Ann,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>MY DEEPEST apologies for not getting back to you sooner - the weekend piled up for work for me and time has flown! \u00a0Please let me know if you'd still like me to send the dress - I think you are travelling now so I absolutely understand if I don't hear from you right away.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm happy to send it to your son's in PA - my friends whom I sent the dresses to in Canada had no problems with duty\/customs however we may have just been lucky. \u00a0I can also send it to Canada - either way I'm happy to help!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope you're having a wonderful time!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Lise<\/p>\n","PostKey":"2e0badf7fc80a5e119620868c7d6bb93","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19364,"Author":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1437564417,"Content":"Hi Lise. not to worry! Yes we're on holiday now so believe me it's not an issue. It's absolutely steaming here in South Carolina! A bit more than we bargained for but at least we're getting a summer!!<br><br>\nI DEFINiTELY want the dress!!! But I'm working with limited wifi here. Would itbe ok to do itnext week when we're home? If the girls had no issue with mail the itbe happier to have it sent to Canada. We won't see my son after this Sunday probably until end of September before we leave for Mexico on the 18th of October.<br><br>\nLet me know if that works ok for you.<br>\nThanks<br>\nAnn","PostKey":"f07b10679ccc6bed9caa89026faeeb75","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19537,"Author":{"Id":282134,"Name":"Mrsntobe","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282134.jpg?_r=1441149164","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1438073823,"Content":"<p>Hey Ann,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Not a problem - let me know if you want me to ship it out this week - I'm on the road for work but back Thursday night, then Saturday morning I'm leaving for Mexico ad will return on August 13th. \u00a0Before or after is fine by me!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope you had a great time in South Carolina!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Lise<\/p>\n","PostKey":"b6c002419cee9a2fbcb4f196cea437b1","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19601,"Author":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1438201806,"Content":"<p>Hi Lise,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can you send a paypal request to achadwick9@gmail.com and I'll get it done tonight. If you have a moment to send it by mail here that would be great but I leave it to you. Let me know when you need the address here and I'll pass it along. I know all about hectic schedules, believe me! lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Whatever works for you is fine by me. South Carolina was hot! lol Very, very hot! But we had a great time and Charleston is really an interesting place to visit.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks again!<\/p>\n<p>Ann<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n","PostKey":"96d8c39d881caa7fe3c73954d4f291bd","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":20125,"Author":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1440424928,"Content":"<p>Hi Lise!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I haven't heard anything from you but I wanted to say i hope your wedding was absolutely fabulous!! I really hope you come back to the site and post a review and pictures! I know everyone would love to read and see!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Are you still interested in selling the dress? I just wondered.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope all is well and that you had a wonderful trip and beautiful wedding, and that it was everything you wanted and more!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>All the best,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ann<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n","PostKey":"ae66af9b314d3bad794ea8884cd95eb9","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":20247,"Author":{"Id":282134,"Name":"Mrsntobe","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282134.jpg?_r=1441149164","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1441133361,"Content":"<p>HI Ann,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My DEEPEST apologies for not getting back to you sooner. \u00a0I have been so so busy with work, and my green card and all sorts of things. \u00a0If you'd still like the dress, please let me know and I'll ship it out to you ASAP. \u00a0Because its been such a pain I'll make it $30, plus shipping - I know it's a pain to wait on people so I truly do apologize!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm looking forward to this weekend because I'm committing to finally getting caught up on this website and putting in my reviews etc. \u00a0I'm putting in a review now for Moments that Matter Photography just because Lincoln has been so so amazing throughout all of this and it is the least I could do.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So please let me know if that works for you and I'm happy to ship it out!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope you're getting excited for your big day - it will be so much fun!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>All the best,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>LIse<\/p>\n","PostKey":"0a8d89212db8c86aae9547e28ad333f5","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":20248,"Author":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1441137427,"Content":"<p>Hi Lise!!! How are you???? How was your wedding??? I'm so, so anxious to hear about it!!! I see you changed your profile photo but I can't get a really good look at it! I hope you're going to post photos really soon!!! I can't wait!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Absolutely if you still want to sell it I would very much like the dress. I think it will be a nice style for either our night before dinner or the night out that we're planning later in the week.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let me know how you want to work it. If we can I would prefer having it shipped here. I can pass on the address whenever you're ready.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My daughter in law has decided to be a rotten little so and so (as usual) and is now squawking about the number of things being delivered there so we've put a stop to it just to shut her up. I don't understand why - it's not like she is being asked to pay for anything. She's just being the rotten little bitch that she usually is (so sorry for the language). I feel so sorry for my son married to her. If it wasn't for our 3 grandsons, I would strongly encourage him to leave her. He does everything and she does nothing. He works all day and still has to make meals and clean. Only thing she's good at is picking up her phone and ordering pizza. Ok - enough of my venting. Sorry. It just has me so frustrated!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm so anxious to hear about your wedding!! Congrats on being a Mrs!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ann<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n","PostKey":"94eba55f469f96b06e5eacb61da9cec9","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":20249,"Author":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1441138151,"Content":"<p>Hi Lise!!! How are you???? How was your wedding??? I'm so, so anxious to hear about it!!! I see you changed your profile photo but I can't get a really good look at it! I hope you're going to post photos really soon!!! I can't wait!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Absolutely if you still want to sell it I would very much like the dress. I think it will be a nice style for either our night before dinner or the night out that we're planning later in the week.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let me know how you want to work it. If we can I would prefer having it shipped here. I can pass on the address whenever you're ready.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My daughter in law has decided to be a rotten little so and so (as usual) and is now squawking about the number of things being delivered there so we've put a stop to it just to shut her up. I don't understand why - it's not like she is being asked to pay for anything. She's just being the rotten little bitch that she usually is (so sorry for the language). I feel so sorry for my son married to her. If it wasn't for our 3 grandsons, I would strongly encourage him to leave her. He does everything and she does nothing. He works all day and still has to make meals and clean. Only thing she's good at is picking up her phone and ordering pizza. Ok - enough of my venting. Sorry. It just has me so frustrated!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm so anxious to hear about your wedding!! Congrats on being a Mrs!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Ann<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n","PostKey":"3182613dca9e66626ab3e55c94069ccc","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":20362,"Author":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1441786169,"Content":"Hi Lise,<br><br>\nI just wondered if you still want to sell your dress? I'm getting close to getting ready for Mexico (6 weeks to go!!) and it will get to a point that the dress won't arrive before we leave. I'm trying to get all of the wardrobe done in advance if I can.<br><br>\nPlease let me know. If you aren't able to sell it that's perfectly OK. <br><br>\nHope married life is wonderful!!<br><br>\nCheers!<br>\nAnn","PostKey":"393b36cb50be16b9bc3847e68505742b","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":14,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
