  'forumId' => '14',
  'title' => 'Catholic Destination Wedding Cancun/ Riviera Maya ',
  'postContent' => 'Hello all! My fiancé and I were recently engaged this past summer in July. We are so excited to start our planning! It looks like the determining factor for our venue is going to be that the resort has a chapel bc the catholic religion won\'t recognize a wedding done outside of a chapel. Any recommendations on a venue?? We are looking into the Gran Caribe Real and the Barcelo Maya. Those are the two that are closest to the room rates we\'d like for our guests. Thanks for the help! ',
  'follow' => 'False',
  'sessionId' => 'af95a3e90540a49f5f0d9823f14734df',
)
