Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1423402124,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77bfc62be19a2191c5376af518446b48","RawContent":"[quote name=\"perianjay\" post=\"1885637\" timestamp=\"1423416337\"]\nThat&#039;s an amazing price! We are hoping to keep ours under 10k.. \n\n\nI know.. I&#039;m really hoping to get some response to my questions sometime this week. The suspense is killing me! haha[\/quote]You can do it!!! It kind of just worked out. We picked the resort and then figured out what it would cost and set a budget we had to save per month to have it paid off at the time Of the wedding. It was tough but we did it. When I realized it was doable I stuck to my budget and it was hard to get me to budge. There are pros and cons to this LOL. In the end I think we spent $17000 in total Which is respectable as a wedding at home would have cost way way more than that and we got a week in paradise. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1885638,"PostDate":1423402057,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>perianjay, on 08 February 2015 - 01:25 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\nThat's an amazing price! We are hoping to keep ours under 10k.. <br><br><br>\nI know.. I'm really hoping to get some response to my questions sometime this week. The suspense is killing me! haha<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nYou can do it!!! It kind of just worked out. We picked the resort and then figured out what it would cost and set a budget we had to save per month to have it paid off at the time Of the wedding. It was tough but we did it. When I realized it was doable I stuck to my budget and it was hard to get me to budge. There are pros and cons to this LOL. In the end I think we spent $17000 in total Which is respectable as a wedding at home would have cost way way more than that and we got a week in paradise. <br><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.51.153.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"057e7b23a40adc19cc06b1c966e6635f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1885638\" timestamp=\"1423416457\"]\nYou can do it!!! It kind of just worked out. We picked the resort and then figured out what it would cost and set a budget we had to save per month to have it paid off at the time Of the wedding. It was tough but we did it. When I realized it was doable I stuck to my budget and it was hard to get me to budge. There are pros and cons to this LOL. In the end I think we spent $17000 in total Which is respectable as a wedding at home would have cost way way more than that and we got a week in paradise.\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]Yea, the FI and I have been cutting back on certain things and being strict with saving. We don&#039;t want to go into any sort of debt for the wedding.  I&#039;m also buying decor stuff and little things with money outside of the wedding savings fund.. I won&#039;t notice it as much this way haha.","Attachments":[],"Id":1885652,"PostDate":1423412207,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 08 February 2015 - 01:27 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>You can do it!!! It kind of just worked out. We picked the resort and then figured out what it would cost and set a budget we had to save per month to have it paid off at the time Of the wedding. It was tough but we did it. When I realized it was doable I stuck to my budget and it was hard to get me to budge. There are pros and cons to this LOL. In the end I think we spent $17000 in total Which is respectable as a wedding at home would have cost way way more than that and we got a week in paradise.<br><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Yea, the FI and I have been cutting back on certain things and being strict with saving. We don't want to go into any sort of debt for the wedding. \u00a0I'm also buying decor stuff and little things with money outside of the wedding savings fund.. I won't notice it as much this way haha.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.223.235","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c13ec7061b7a79aa44e8caed431731ff","RawContent":"[quote name=\"perianjay\" post=\"1885652\" timestamp=\"1423426607\"]\nYea, the FI and I have been cutting back on certain things and being strict with saving. We don&#039;t want to go into any sort of debt for the wedding.  I&#039;m also buying decor stuff and little things with money outside of the wedding savings fund.. I won&#039;t notice it as much this way haha.[\/quote]I agree. We did OOT and gifts and such outside the wedding budget. Debt wasn&#039;t an option for me. As a single mom for years that stressed me out :)\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1885659,"PostDate":1423417536,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>perianjay, on 08 February 2015 - 04:16 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Yea, the FI and I have been cutting back on certain things and being strict with saving. We don't want to go into any sort of debt for the wedding.  I'm also buying decor stuff and little things with money outside of the wedding savings fund.. I won't notice it as much this way haha.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nI agree. We did OOT and gifts and such outside the wedding budget. Debt wasn't an option for me. As a single mom for years that stressed me out <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.51.153.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1423418140,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5092a21e77e4f3d0486ed5c7a3a8da37","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I will be sharing different things here sporadically. I just wanted to share my DIY \"MRS &amp;amp; MR\" chair signs.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;I sourced the glitter paper and mint coloured cardstock from Michaels. It cost be just under $10 to make, which is fine by me because the same thing on Etsy can go for more!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;My only worry is that they may be a bit oversized for the Tiffany Chairs..&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885660,"PostDate":1423418089,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I will be sharing different things here sporadically. I just wanted to share my DIY \"MRS & MR\" chair signs.<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">I sourced the glitter paper and mint coloured cardstock from Michaels. It cost be just under $10 to make, which is fine by me because the same thing on Etsy can go for more!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1885660]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281478-0-18319700-1423432477.jpg\" title=\"20150201_093947.jpg -  78.98KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281478-0-18319700-1423432477.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"20150201_093947.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">My only worry is that they may be a bit oversized for the Tiffany Chairs..\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c7f17cd0e92d55572cc5a767cfd60e19","RawContent":"@[member=\"perianjay\"] we&#039;re also trying to stick to our $10,000 budget but finding it so hard with the exchange rate. This won&#039;t include our air and hotel package and we&#039;ve also tried buying things as they go on sale. We already have our OOT bags since weddingchicks had a 50% off last year and will now try (though dreading it) see if the closure of Target can be of benefit to us \n\n\nHey how did you do your chair signs? I gave no creativity whatsoever in me! I envy you","Attachments":[],"Id":1885661,"PostDate":1423418450,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> we're also trying to stick to our $10,000 budget but finding it so hard with the exchange rate. This won't include our air and hotel package and we've also tried buying things as they go on sale. We already have our OOT bags since weddingchicks had a 50% off last year and will now try (though dreading it) see if the closure of Target can be of benefit to us <br><br>\nHey how did you do your chair signs? I gave no creativity whatsoever in me! I envy you\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410084185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1441055220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.51.153.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1423418799,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bbf784e3b306c9b2e3ecb0eed365a3fe","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Wafflesmom\" post=\"1885661\" timestamp=\"1423432850\"]\n@[member=\"perianjay\"] we&#039;re also trying to stick to our $10,000 budget but finding it so hard with the exchange rate. This won&#039;t include our air and hotel package and we&#039;ve also tried buying things as they go on sale. We already have our OOT bags since weddingchicks had a 50% off last year and will now try (though dreading it) see if the closure of Target can be of benefit to us\n\nHey how did you do your chair signs? I gave no creativity whatsoever in me! I envy you[\/quote]@[member=\"Wafflesmom\"] I know!! The USD rate is KILLING ME! Some brides paid in Pesos.. I envy them lol. I love that you got to take advantage of the weddingchicks sale. I&#039;m hoping to do the same thing and just waiting for the email for when they have the sale. I have 80% of the content for my OOT bags.. will post that shortly. Dollarama actually carries some great finds for the bag.. And a lot of brand name things which is nice.\n\nI am also hoping to find something at Target, but last time I went I was a bit disappointed. \n\nFor the signs I just printed out the letters using Microsoft Word, cut the letters out one by one, and then I traced them (upside down - so you wouldn&#039;t see pencil on the front of the letters) on to the cardstock, cut them out and used spray glue to bond them! I just used a regular hole punch to make holes near the tops so that I could attach them with ribbon. It was a bit time consuming cutting out the letters, but I felt accomplished after :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1885663,"PostDate":1423418754,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Wafflesmom, on 08 February 2015 - 06:00 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> we're also trying to stick to our $10,000 budget but finding it so hard with the exchange rate. This won't include our air and hotel package and we've also tried buying things as they go on sale. We already have our OOT bags since weddingchicks had a 50% off last year and will now try (though dreading it) see if the closure of Target can be of benefit to us<br><br>\nHey how did you do your chair signs? I gave no creativity whatsoever in me! I envy you<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279721\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279721-wafflesmom\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Wafflesmom<\/span><\/a> I know!! The USD rate is KILLING ME! Some brides paid in Pesos.. I envy them lol. I love that you got to take advantage of the weddingchicks sale. I'm hoping to do the same thing and just waiting for the email for when they have the sale. I have 80% of the content for my OOT bags.. will post that shortly. Dollarama actually carries some great finds for the bag.. And a lot of brand name things which is nice.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am also hoping to find something at Target, but last time I went I was a bit disappointed.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For the signs I just printed out the letters using Microsoft Word, cut the letters out one by one, and then I traced them (upside down - so you wouldn't see pencil on the front of the letters) on to the cardstock, cut them out and used spray glue to bond them! I just used a regular hole punch to make holes near the tops so that I could attach them with ribbon. It was a bit time consuming cutting out the letters, but I felt accomplished after <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"95d521af292f02ae8f77f9674bdbb1d4","RawContent":"[quote name=\"perianjay\" post=\"1885663\" timestamp=\"1423433154\"]\n@[member=\"Wafflesmom\"] I know!! The USD rate is KILLING ME! Some brides paid in Pesos.. I envy them lol. I love that you got to take advantage of the weddingchicks sale. I&#039;m hoping to do the same thing and just waiting for the email for when they have the sale. I have 80% of the content for my OOT bags.. will post that shortly. Dollarama actually carries some great finds for the bag.. And a lot of brand name things which is nice.\n \nI am also hoping to find something at Target, but last time I went I was a bit disappointed. \n \nFor the signs I just printed out the letters using Microsoft Word, cut the letters out one by one, and then I traced them (upside down - so you wouldn&#039;t see pencil on the front of the letters) on to the cardstock, cut them out and used spray glue to bond them! I just used a regular hole punch to make holes near the tops so that I could attach them with ribbon. It was a bit time consuming cutting out the letters, but I felt accomplished after :)[\/quote]@[member=\"perianjay\"] Paying in pesos would be so nice! I hope the dollar goes up soon, it just pains me to lose so much money! And it&#039;s something we don&#039;t have any control over!\n\nOh the weddingchicks sale is definitely worth waiting for, I&#039;m surprised I haven&#039;t seen anything lately. Maybe there will be one for Valentine&#039;s Day? I&#039;ll check out dollarama, thanks for the tip.\n\nAnd thanks for the instructions. It will take time but at least it will save us money","Attachments":[],"Id":1885665,"PostDate":1423419078,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>perianjay, on 08 February 2015 - 06:05 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279721\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279721-wafflesmom\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Wafflesmom<\/span><\/a> I know!! The USD rate is KILLING ME! Some brides paid in Pesos.. I envy them lol. I love that you got to take advantage of the weddingchicks sale. I'm hoping to do the same thing and just waiting for the email for when they have the sale. I have 80% of the content for my OOT bags.. will post that shortly. Dollarama actually carries some great finds for the bag.. And a lot of brand name things which is nice.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nI am also hoping to find something at Target, but last time I went I was a bit disappointed.\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nFor the signs I just printed out the letters using Microsoft Word, cut the letters out one by one, and then I traced them (upside down - so you wouldn't see pencil on the front of the letters) on to the cardstock, cut them out and used spray glue to bond them! I just used a regular hole punch to make holes near the tops so that I could attach them with ribbon. It was a bit time consuming cutting out the letters, but I felt accomplished after <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> Paying in pesos would be so nice! I hope the dollar goes up soon, it just pains me to lose so much money! And it's something we don't have any control over!<br><br>\nOh the weddingchicks sale is definitely worth waiting for, I'm surprised I haven't seen anything lately. Maybe there will be one for Valentine's Day? I'll check out dollarama, thanks for the tip.<br><br>\nAnd thanks for the instructions. It will take time but at least it will save us money \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410084185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1441055220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.51.153.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"425a10d3e2780d91cb4e7045a648ba77","RawContent":"[u][b]My OOT bags thus far[\/b][\/u]\n\n\n[size=4]So here is what i&#039;ve picked up so far.. (not all quantities shown in the picture of course - I have over twenty of everything)[\/size]\n\n[size=4]Excel mints - Dollarama .77 cents[\/size]\n[size=4]Bath and Body works sanitizer - 3 for $5.00[\/size]\n[size=4]Kleenex Tissue - $2.00 for a pack of ten (Dollarama)[\/size]\n[size=4]Wet Wipes - Dollarama $1.00[\/size]\nI Love ... Bubble Bath\/Body wash (A total PALACE need with the giant tubs in the room!) - Found them at shoppers after Christmas sale, 6 pack was originally $13.00, got them for $6.00. - I bought 4 packs of 6.\nBlistex - $1.25 from Dollarama (good because it has an SPF in it as well)\nAdvil - 24 pack. $1.79 + tax (I got these using a coupon from the Advil website. The No Frills grocery store sells the 24 pack for $4.79. Technically the coupon is supposed to be used on 50 pack or more, but the grocery store never reads the coupon properly... lol)\n\nI plan on buying a few more items, but haven&#039;t decided what yet. Open to ideas! :) \n\n[quote name=\"Wafflesmom\" post=\"1885665\" timestamp=\"1423433478\"]\n@[member=\"perianjay\"] Paying in pesos would be so nice! I hope the dollar goes up soon, it just pains me to lose so much money! And it&#039;s something we don&#039;t have any control over!\n\nOh the weddingchicks sale is definitely worth waiting for, I&#039;m surprised I haven&#039;t seen anything lately. Maybe there will be one for Valentine&#039;s Day? I&#039;ll check out dollarama, thanks for the tip.\n\nAnd thanks for the instructions. It will take time but at least it will save us money[\/quote]\nNo worries! Anything to save a bit considering it really all does add up. In the start of my planning I didn&#039;t realize all of the little things I wanted would be so costly (Ie. lighting) so i&#039;m trying to make small cuts here and there so that I can have most of what I want","Attachments":[],"Id":1885666,"PostDate":1423419534,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><u><strong>My OOT bags thus far<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1885666]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281478-0-45174200-1423433495.jpg\" title=\"20150208_170907.jpg -  75.53KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281478-0-45174200-1423433495.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"20150208_170907.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">So here is what i've picked up so far.. (not all quantities shown in the picture of course - I have over twenty of everything)<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Excel mints - Dollarama .77 cents<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Bath and Body works sanitizer - 3 for $5.00<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Kleenex Tissue - $2.00 for a pack of ten (Dollarama)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\">Wet Wipes - Dollarama $1.00<\/span><\/p>\n<p>I Love ... Bubble Bath\/Body wash (A total PALACE need with the giant tubs in the room!) - Found them at shoppers after Christmas sale, 6 pack was originally $13.00, got them for $6.00. - I bought 4 packs of 6.<\/p>\n<p>Blistex - $1.25 from Dollarama (good because it has an SPF in it as well)<\/p>\n<p>Advil - 24 pack. $1.79 + tax (I got these using a coupon from the Advil website. The No Frills grocery store sells the 24 pack for $4.79. Technically the coupon is supposed to be used on 50 pack or more, but the grocery store never reads the coupon properly... lol)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I plan on buying a few more items, but haven't decided what yet. Open to ideas! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Wafflesmom, on 08 February 2015 - 06:11 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> Paying in pesos would be so nice! I hope the dollar goes up soon, it just pains me to lose so much money! And it's something we don't have any control over!<br><br>\nOh the weddingchicks sale is definitely worth waiting for, I'm surprised I haven't seen anything lately. Maybe there will be one for Valentine's Day? I'll check out dollarama, thanks for the tip.<br><br>\nAnd thanks for the instructions. It will take time but at least it will save us money<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>No worries! Anything to save a bit considering it really all does add up. In the start of my planning I didn't realize all of the little things I wanted would be so costly (Ie. lighting) so i'm trying to make small cuts here and there so that I can have most of what I want<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f5f589c878800894bf22bdf40635f7bb","RawContent":"BBW always has coupons. I got most of my hand sani for under $0.80 each. \n\n\nAlso I found coupons for the Pepto and emergen-c haha I spent a lot of time online. \n\n\nI was a lucky bride who paid in peso. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1885671,"PostDate":1423424179,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                BBW always has coupons. I got most of my hand sani for under $0.80 each. <br><br>\nAlso I found coupons for the Pepto and emergen-c haha I spent a lot of time online. <br><br>\nI was a lucky bride who paid in peso. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.51.153.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78755,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"310bb9c66461d53db75a28806bcade3a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] Oh wow that&#039;s pretty awesome! I didn&#039;t even think to use a coupon at BBW.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I need to look into some more couponing options! :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885681,"PostDate":1423427548,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> Oh wow that's pretty awesome! I didn't even think to use a coupon at BBW.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I need to look into some more couponing options! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":903,"TotalPages":91,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":900},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
